Package: mdreader
Version: 1.3.0
Section: text
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, xdg-utils
Maintainer: Sanjib Sikder
Description: Clean Markdown reader (opens .md files in the browser)
 Renders Markdown with book-style typography, LaTeX maths (MathJax),
 code highlighting, tables, task lists, Mermaid diagrams and callouts.
 Reader only, no editor. Command: mdview FILE.md
